  "title": "Zesty Dense Indian Lamb Curry",
  "description": "A salty and dense Hyderabadi dish featuring lamb and a blend of spices, perfect for a sick day, and made in a kadhai vessel with Buddhist-temple-friendly ingredients, including a sweet and sour candy note from the addition of dried mango powder and a touch of sugar.",
