  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a kadhai vessel over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until it is lightly browned.",
    "Add the ginger and garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb and cook until it is browned on all sides.",
    "Add the curry powder, turmeric, cumin, cayenne pepper, and salt, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add 1 cup of water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 1 1/2 hours.",
    "Stir in the dried mango powder and sugar.",
    "Simmer, uncovered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve hot.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro, if desired."
